---
 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.h      |  31 ++
 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_ppe.c      | 386 +++++++++++++-----
 .../net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_ppe_debugfs.c  |  43 +-
